", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974685_1840524873122821_3055739933188055904_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=W8ZQSaW8XK4Q7kNvwE9ez8j&_nc_oc=AdqdvuJCrv2rEPCPi0MOz5saSY8xr6b8hEilTCHGzI-OI3OsebyuKJYZGO9ySovhDd0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3Uss20siG2KBbj_9zeMbejKMKNvKmUj5-WtXJekdzDUQ&oe=69E62C79"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "3474397939524850", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974494_3474397942858183_7325370313459975246_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YUhvjxwjp9MQ7kNvwE5ebqk&_nc_oc=Ado3yvCEeqh5fgi9uJhIbaUKdNuF1cHE6Go4E6JPJJ6XQmsnuekLlCRNsPVq6E4rBuI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0K5dlAFQTZp9wuNweidRosnh8RptWQZiBK-1iksPAvhw&oe=69E6434B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Hard Drive Logo (6).png", "id": "1060475455596738", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984476_1060475458930071_8663595066419356644_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=REUoyWo85i8Q7kNvwGJmulo&_nc_oc=AdqTjvmJhZ7WYMHGpkVsRJlpOBImb789Az85pqyvwWseoj4Cvv5epM6OMX0t7o_Tzyo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2IgJOfAct1XWlaYpkE6MmFm8_baKDf6qbeUaha4lXEag&oe=69E641CE"}, "display_name": "Hard Drive", "keywords": [], "long_description": "# *Hard Drive* \n\nHard Drive is a fast-paced, multiplayer, competitive electro combat driving game. Players control sleek, neon-lit motorcycle looking vehicles, known as bykes, which leave behind a temporary solid trail of light as they move. Players must outmaneuver their opponents by creating a trails of light that they cannot avoid crashing into, while avoiding the trails left by other players.\n\n# _Current Features_\n- Non PvP Driving Park\n- 6 Player Combat Arena\n- Season Pass with Progression Rewards\n- Cosmetic Shop \n\n## More Coming Soon. . .", "short_description": "Electro Combat Driving "}]}, "devel